WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.168
♪♪

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:02.628
Marjan:
We're playing a long game here.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.421
Marjan:
Not just one operation,...

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:05.255
(Radio chatter)

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.340
Marjan:
...but hundreds of them.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.216
♪♪

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:11.053
Marjan:
Now that we're working together,
my life depends on the decisions you make. 

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.596
♪♪

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:15.349
Marjan:
Unless we're completely
transparent with each other...

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:15.766
(Gun cocking)

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:18.310
Marjan:
...it will end very badly for
us. 

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:21.230
♪♪

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:23.148
Do you understand?

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:26.526
♪♪

